# Flashes the ESP32-S3-DevKitC of esp32-s3-usb over USB-Serial-JTAG (8 MiB flash): the
# connection of connect-esp32s3-usb, then bootloader.bin at 0x0, the partition table generated
# from esp32-s3-8mb.toml at 0x8000 (0xC00 bytes, MD5 of `nanoflash layout write --format
# espressif`) and application.bin at 0x20000, one compressed block each, three MD5 checks, and
# the reset into the application.
! identity 303a:1001
! signals dtr=0 rts=0
! sleep 100
! signals dtr=1 rts=0
! sleep 100
! signals dtr=1 rts=1
! signals dtr=0 rts=1
! sleep 100
